v style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">dr. sc. Suzana Obrovac Lipar</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Odnosi s javnošću</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">HK</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">Hana Kilijan</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Komunikologija</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">VN</div><div><div style=\"font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #14181d;\">Veronika Novoselac</div><div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #4f535a; margin-top: 1px;\">Suradnica</div><div style=\"font-size: 12.5px; color: #8a8e95;\">HKS · Povijest</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e4e2da; border-radius: 10px; padding: 22px; display: flex; gap: 16px; align-items: center;\"><div style=\"width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; background: #eaf0f2; color: #0f4c5c; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; flex: none;\">MT</div><div><div style=\"font-w